# q38-27b-nvfp4-df2.recipe -- unsloth's Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 with the DFlash2 drafter.
#
#   rad-convert <unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4> --draft-model <z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2> \
#       --recipe q38-27b-nvfp4-df2.recipe -o q38-27b-nvfp4-df2.rad
#
# The checkpoint is compressed-tensors mixed precision: the MLPs of layers 0-55 are NVFP4 (e2m1
# codes, an e4m3 scale per 16 of K, an f32 global scale per tensor); the attention and delta-net
# projections, the MLPs of layers 56-63 and the lm_head are FP8 with a bf16 scale per row; the
# delta net's a/b projections, the vision tower and the MTP head are bf16. The core decodes each
# exactly, and every rule below quantises the decoded value, so one recipe covers all forms.
#
#   - The trunk's linears at MXFP4 (`fp4_e2m1`, an e8m0 scale per 32 of K, the OCP exponent
#     rule): the encoding and kernel of q38-27b-quark-mxfp4-df2.recipe. No kernel serves NVFP4.
#     NVFP4 to MXFP4 rounds twice: on a synthetic Gaussian tensor the result is 0.14 relative
#     RMS from the source, against 0.12 for MXFP4 made from the source and 0.10 for NVFP4. At
#     model scale, against the block-fp8 Qwen3.8-27B on four documents: mean KL 0.287, top-1
#     87.5% (the Quark MXFP4 container: 0.206, 89.3%).
#   - The delta net's a/b projections stay bf16, as shipped: 96 rows of 5120, read as their own
#     projection beside [q|k|v|z].
#   - The lm_head at block fp8 (from its per-row FP8), as in the other 27B recipes.
#
# The drafter as q38-27b-quark-mxfp4-df2.recipe makes it: its linears at MXFP4, and a 2-bit copy
# of the target's head (u2 with a u8 zero, least-squares clip search) whose top 32 the engine
# rescores against the target's fp8 head.

blk.*.ffn_gate_up.weight                 rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
blk.*.ffn_down.weight                    rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
blk.*.attn_qg.weight                     rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
blk.*.attn_k.weight                      rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
blk.*.attn_v.weight                      rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
blk.*.attn_output.weight                 rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
blk.*.ssm_inz.weight                     rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
blk.*.ssm_out.weight                     rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0

output.weight                            rtn  codes=fp8_e4m3 block=128x128 scale=bf16
dflash.draft_head.weight                 rtn  codes=u2 zero=u8 group=128 scale=f16 rule=search

dflash.fc.weight                         rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
dflash.blk.*.attn_q.weight               rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
dflash.blk.*.attn_k.weight               rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
dflash.blk.*.attn_v.weight               rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
dflash.blk.*.attn_output.weight          rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
dflash.blk.*.ffn_gate_up.weight          rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
dflash.blk.*.ffn_down.weight             rtn  codes=fp4_e2m1 group=32 scale=e8m0
